---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Client Reviews | ATECT Architecture" description="Client feedback for ATECT Architecture from the firm's published project testimonials.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="eyebrow">Reviews</div><h1>Client experience matters.</h1><p>Selected testimonials published by ATECT Architecture's existing site.</p></section>
<section class="section"><div class="review-grid"><article><div class="quote">“Mr. Jones has been very professional as he provided the architect drawings for an addition of a Sunroom and Screened patio for my home.”</div><div class="attribution">D. Trott</div></article><article><div class="quote">“I greatly appreciate all your help. I will definitely recommend your company to others.”</div><div class="attribution">R. Staiger</div></article></div><p class="review-note">These testimonials are presented as published by ATECT Architecture. The full original reviews remain on the firm's existing site.</p><a class="button dark" href="/contact">Start Your Project</a></section>
</Layout>
<style is:global>.review-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px}.review-grid article{padding:40px;background:#f5f5f2;border:1px solid #ddd}.quote{font:500 clamp(22px,3vw,34px)/1.35 Manrope}.attribution{margin-top:24px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}.review-note{margin:25px 0 30px;color:#666;font-size:14px}@media(max-width:800px){.review-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
